# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     angle 8
# RESETIUS |     axiom C88FX
# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     F=
# RESETIUS |     X=+FY-<1-@2F@I2X+>1+FY-
# RESETIUS |     Y=@Q2F@I2X@Q2
# RESETIUS |   }
